"3f9a2c1 config: rename scroll_off to scrolloff Alice Martin 12/10/2026 (HEAD -> main, tag: v1.0, origin/main) "
"                                                                                                              "
"The option is named `scrolloff` in vim, using the same name makes it                                          "
"easier to find. `usize` avoids casts when computing screen offsets.                                           "
"                                                                                                              "
